<h2>Podcaster. Speaker. Leader. Organiser.</h2>

<p>Over the past 30 years, I've honed my craft with digital products, now an experienced leader in tech having worked with international brands like <a href="https://rightmove.co.uk/">Rightmove</a>, <a href="https://asos.com/">ASOS</a>, <a href="https://www.alibabagroup.com/">Alibaba Group</a>, <a href="https://www.uefa.com/">UEFA</a> and <a href="https://www.yahoo.com">Yahoo!</a>.</p>
<p>I've also continued to create growing community and podcast products around shared passions such as House Finesse, Multipack and On The Side.</p>
<p>Find out more on my <a href="/about/">About page</a></p>

